#: ../../source/docs/common-polygon_fence.rst:6
#: 5ae2078381dd4e0fb3b15f80d0ce2516 5c4757f39e274a869a4333dac2d82c16
#: 9646c5364e2745fc83d83bf7a6d1a462 9b36bcac9db44ab2b736e70c51d46106
#: a1c716867fab4c67baaf04237dbb9343
msgid "Inclusion and Exclusion Fences"
msgstr "包含围栏和排除围栏"

#: ../../source/docs/common-polygon_fence.rst:9
#: 06d26f0bd3114c5ba9891d6b0eee4e62 33c4bb3a156847df9d570524cbae4e20
#: 58d39484c00f49dfa8a41fb222ff5d1c 88644ea62c12492da0dc9094e5c200c8
#: ae1862afd2fe4db98373d03542ec379d
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "概述"

#: ../../source/docs/common-polygon_fence.rst:11
#: 5880bc662ab14c2b8646455cda16cf89 696099f277cc4d58812890a42d9eb458
#: c81fc1db0ad948e896669f7484199d3f c8c854acaa0e4d18b0a49bcf218ac50b
#: cdda6d8d7032422983d2ababb56e37ec
msgid ""
"ArduPilot includes support for polygon fences with up to 70 points and for "
"pure circular fences with specified radii. Unlike the home-based cylindrical"
" fence :ref:`cylindrical fence <common-ac2_simple_geofence>`, the circular "
"inclusion/exclusion fence can be placed anywhere. Either the polygonal or "
"circular fences may be selected to be inclusion or exclusion type, and may "
"be mixed. The purpose of these fences are to attempt to stop your vehicle "
"from flying into (exclusion), or out of (inclusion), the fences by "
"initiating a failsafe action like RTL (See "
":ref:`FENCE_ACTION<FENCE_ACTION>`) or, if flying in Loiter mode for Copter "
"and :ref:`common-object-avoidance-landing-page` is setup, the vehicle will "
"normally stop before breaching the fence and in some cases, plan paths "
"around the boundaries."
msgstr ""
"ArduPilot 支持最多 70 个顶点的多边形围栏以及指定半径的纯圆形围栏。与基于 Home 点的圆柱形围栏 :ref:`圆柱形围栏 "
"<common-ac2_simple_geofence>` "
"不同，圆形包含/排除围栏可以放置在任意位置。多边形或圆形围栏均可选择设置为包含或排除类型，且可以混合使用。这些围栏的目的是通过触发失控保护动作（如 "
"RTL，参见 :ref:`FENCE_ACTION<FENCE_ACTION>`）来阻止飞行器进入（排除）或飞出（包含）围栏；如果 Copter 在 "
"Loiter 模式下飞行且已设置 :ref:`common-object-avoidance-landing-"
"page`，飞行器通常会在越界前停止，并在某些情况下规划绕开边界的路径。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-polygon_fence.rst:13
#: 7f4b45c912934364bc9c64fe7db82c6a 88771584cea244258c4cb798123ce1e0
#: a27d989af89d414fa6a19c72d2871d46 dc660d3fb088450f8366ba26ad45e1b4
#: e4e08fc184d34aaba285c0fe1d225f67
msgid ""
"This feature is an extension of the simpler home-based :ref:`cylindrical "
"fence <common-ac2_simple_geofence>` and can be combined with it."
msgstr ""
"此功能是更简单的基于 Home 点的 :ref:`圆柱形围栏 <common-ac2_simple_geofence>` 的扩展，可与其结合使用。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-polygon_fence.rst:15
#: 3c04525f38074e4fac8e739c594a5855 3e5f7c7ea77d4d5eabf8b8dae8cbe425
#: 84745556fb1d482da91fe55c41901e0c 8dc4b0d381d34111b8f22f294e4ea0fc
#: f8453552708a4c2f8b5eb20f842f3c2d
msgid ""
"While Copter and Rover can use :ref:`common-object-avoidance-landing-page` "
"strategies to avoid most fence breaches, Plane only has airborne aircraft "
":ref:`ADSB avoidance <common-ads-b-receiver>`. For safety, plan your polygon"
" fences anticipating the path of whatever :ref:`FENCE_ACTION<FENCE_ACTION>` "
"is selected upon breach. This usually means significantly larger fence "
"boundaries than what is being protected."
msgstr ""
"虽然 Copter 和 Rover 可以使用 :ref:`common-object-avoidance-landing-page` "
"策略来避免大多数围栏越界，但 Plane 只有机载 :ref:`ADSB 避障 <common-ads-b-"
"receiver>`。为安全起见，在规划多边形围栏时，应考虑越界后 :ref:`FENCE_ACTION<FENCE_ACTION>` "
"所选动作的飞行路径。这通常意味着围栏边界应远大于实际保护区域。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-polygon_fence.rst:17
#: 0dc2160df1724b86b2dc9a89d49cfc9f 209bbfb676a24ea190478a5cdaa8b8f1
#: 63b5995b0ac14eb79c5cc827711eba76 c7509bb3547f4da8b2f1bf41ac6ec10f
#: cb331c7f9f5f4c7f874df3bd97a92286
msgid ""
"You can have multiple circular or polygon inclusion or exclusion fences, all"
" active at the same time. The example PLAN screen from Mission Planner, "
"below, shows examples of each. Note that they can overlap, with one another."
" So in the example below the Plane could fly within the union of the large "
"polygonal fence AND within the circular overlapping fence without breaching."
" The example below is not realistic, since with the large inclusion fence, "
"the outside exclusion fences would never be reached and are superfluous, but"
" it shows all the different kinds of fences that can be created."
msgstr ""
"您可以同时设置多个圆形或多边形包含或排除围栏，全部同时生效。以下来自 Mission Planner 的示例 PLAN "
"界面展示了各种围栏示例。请注意，它们可以相互重叠。在示例中，Plane "
"可以在大多边形围栏和圆形重叠围栏的并集范围内飞行而不越界。下面的示例并不切实际，因为有大包含围栏的情况下，外部排除围栏永远不会被触及，是多余的，但它展示了所有可创建的围栏类型。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-polygon_fence.rst:22
#: 09292daa06794f638efb5111ff877278 1855fd48630c4c6d92621c6079c14162
#: 61c38dbbf5f448dd9ad99c0f8a76c695 b762a2c11378496d8c5b256fcac74803
#: c6e9039c285940adbeca047c86b0cd88
msgid ""
"See :ref:`common-geofencing-landing-page` for fence setup parameters common "
"to all fences."
msgstr "有关所有围栏通用的围栏设置参数，请参见 :ref:`common-geofencing-landing-page`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-polygon_fence.rst:24
#: 80401b1c3faf4e929c5b5f1516c8fe42 9938f5e5d3024804881b17fb94db9103
#: b72fdaddafdd45ef9688b3ef40e3f6cd b911f317ada540028b22a3048f2c7d39
#: da891e68ea4f4326905b98273d24b25f
msgid ""
"These fences are created and treated in a similar way to mission command "
"lists and rally point lists and loaded into the autopilot. Each item in the "
"list specifies a point in the polygonal boundary or a circular item, whether"
" its inclusion or exclusion type, and radius if circular. Most GCS provide a"
" graphical drawing facility to add in the design of the fence boundaries and"
" inclusion/exclusion type."
msgstr ""
"这些围栏的创建和处理方式与任务指令列表和集结点列表类似，并加载到飞控中。列表中的每个项目指定多边形边界上的一个点或一个圆形项目、其包含或排除类型，以及圆形时的半径。大多数地面站提供图形绘制工具，用于设计围栏边界和包含/排除类型。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-polygon_fence.rst:26
#: 1752600e3f1146c8afb6e6145de19f12 2eb8046077b44841b1a626362b792a33
#: 3d3e6e2ae97d4baca942bdf76dadbc2b ae759eebf6564f6e8a4d5105eb884cb3
#: f37a96de0be34484adfb98cb279bd0f1
msgid ""
"Multiple fences can be specified of differing types and shapes in the list."
msgstr "列表中可指定多个不同类型和形状的围栏。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-polygon_fence.rst:33
#: 1fb4f94381ec41979dfb074fdbfd8519 7295113c536c4dd79374ce10caff4342
#: 807e9b7396a04f38a0d762754bba533e e167880c1c7546dcb2d3474d3b3a57e0
#: e8352fc90e4341469838a8aef5ee625f
msgid "Number of fences"
msgstr "围栏数量"

#: ../../source/docs/common-polygon_fence.rst:35
#: 8e668b934a874de48a4cef86769fd2b8 90411338089b448fa4087727af139642
#: a6f6717ef21e45268444103cccd21758 ad5890ba80c4484f9c7f4cb6659b0d02
#: b1462159dcd5457fa3828ed957ab1953
msgid ""
"Fences are stored in a separate reserved area of flash in the autopilot from"
" mission items and rally points. The number that can be stored depends on "
"their complexity, but when you go to \"Write\" them to the autopilot, an "
"error message will be displayed if storage limit is exceeded. In this case, "
"you can enable storage on the SD Card by setting the "
":ref:`BRD_SD_FENCE<BRD_SD_FENCE>` parameter to a non-zero size, which will "
"store the fences on SD card instead of internal memory."
msgstr ""
"围栏存储在飞控闪存中与任务项和集结点分开的保留区域。可存储的数量取决于其复杂度，但当您将其「写入」飞控时，如果超出存储限制，将显示错误信息。在这种情况下，可以通过将"
" :ref:`BRD_SD_FENCE<BRD_SD_FENCE>` 参数设置为非零大小来启用 SD 卡存储，从而将围栏存储在 SD "
"卡而非内部存储器中。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-polygon_fence.rst:39
#: 075e439ecae94dd083f67fc5d3d5bfbb 13243ab37b914d23aff04009f8c770b2
#: 7987e8d4cbc04bb885b4898ef1d47268 7a6cb84a0e3846f49fe4577376bb0743
#: f05ca5d8d9604f98a4fccc0b418bc69c
msgid "Other Warnings:"
msgstr "其他警告："

#: ../../source/docs/common-polygon_fence.rst:41
#: 0b024ec4eee04e44a8564f9152e1ed15 0d1cac2d15374a0aa4f7eba8fc5892c8
#: 5de8571552014888846165f47722c51b 6a01e79e4a3b44e79fd46700af3fbf62
#: cecd28f91c6f41208696dab2e73d8ca9
msgid "The minimum recommended fence radius is 30m"
msgstr "建议的最小围栏半径为 30 米"

#: ../../source/docs/common-polygon_fence.rst:42
#: 16d1cb57cfd24a2589d1d33aaa3acb25 7681bfe35eee40ba8e85aabb1f2d2be0
#: 834c9205e7104ac6ade3e0da4c3f75cb b9ef300947d4486b860ed0a783937ee1
#: c86d7333cd024b6c89f75f800b18b164
msgid ""
"The fence requires the GPS to be functioning well so do not disable the "
":ref:`GPS arming check <common-prearm-safety-checks>` nor the :ref:`EKF "
"failsafe <ekf-inav-failsafe>` while the fence is enabled. Conversely, if you"
" disable either of these checks, disable the Fence."
msgstr ""
"围栏需要 GPS 正常工作，因此在启用围栏时，请勿禁用 :ref:`GPS 解锁检查 <common-prearm-safety-checks>` 或 "
":ref:`EKF 失控保护 <ekf-inav-failsafe>`。反之，如果禁用了上述任一检查，请同时禁用围栏。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-polygon_fence.rst:45
#: 55bfa55a9fb84a7db17da92b8c4ccb20 b5ea007182f945f29ac0580225d76f46
#: c53e780f643a44578b319ce3bacec137 d2a687650d63466b8e25dd3bd14988a5
#: f2afc3a3274649dcb3bf17d4ab73a50f
msgid "For the best results, ensure RTL is working on your vehicle."
msgstr "为获得最佳效果，请确保您的飞行器 RTL 功能正常。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-polygon_fence.rst:46
#: 6d8951b2a4db451ba39570613f9f7ccd 779f969c29e94e5aa4fc95409c59db17
#: 8a467b3bdc7f421f96a608d38750c668 a34eff6bd60f42a8abd5172383c44a34
#: c7ba3406bc904f00a4bf024bebfc6f51
msgid ""
"With the Fence enabled in Copter and Rover, the pre-arm checks will require "
"you have GPS lock before arming the vehicle."
msgstr "在 Copter 和 Rover 中启用围栏后，预解锁检查将要求在解锁前获得 GPS 定位锁定。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-polygon_fence.rst:48
#: 35f0cb972d8d40d88f7b16892364e6bc 703a6ab655e74962b1dee7408a9604fa
#: 8ad73360cb9c4d2f8033e834346dd87b 9f9acf6dce984343ada7296f02bf75ef
#: a5cc24c9c95045f694c2d73d2d41ecfa
msgid ""
"In Copter, if EKF failsafe occurs and the Fence is enabled and you lose GPS "
"lock while flying the fence will be disabled."
msgstr "在 Copter 中，如果发生 EKF 失控保护且围栏已启用，在飞行过程中失去 GPS 定位时，围栏将被禁用。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-polygon_fence.rst:50
#: 15e0601b18a54f5db55809415a125a59 1de21242a45f447f8f4c6bc28556709f
#: 6af34dd2274b43af89ea27517b95ce32 ab0af380a16a44b8a9ac7ab3da67ce1f
#: ba20e5ec284a4359a77ff9d0cf78194c
msgid ""
"In Copter, if EKF failsafe occurs and the Fence is enabled and in an "
"autonomous mode, the vehicle will switch to LAND (HOLD for Rover) because we"
" no longer know the vehicle position and we want to ensure the vehicle never"
" travels far outside the fence. If this is not desired, the pilot can retake"
" control by moving the flight mode switch to a manual mode."
msgstr ""
"在 Copter 中，如果发生 EKF 失控保护且围栏已启用并处于自主模式，飞行器将切换到 Land 模式（Rover 为 "
"HOLD），因为我们不再知道飞行器位置，并希望确保飞行器不会飞到围栏外太远。如果不希望这样，飞手可以将飞行模式开关切换到手动模式以重新接管控制。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-polygon_fence.rst:54
#: 1688b97cddfe428ab60560ea72304e0b 2b7c9d988d30432ea898fa56240a988d
#: 8e4d13fffe8a48e8bb74059c0c6831db c094b60516ba4cf5bd9e8dda90f75bb4
#: ec615b06a6014958a3f09449e59fc90c
msgid ""
"The Copter and Rover backup fences are created 20m out from the previous "
"breached fence not 20m out from the vehicle's position.  This means if you "
"choose to override the fence you may have less than 20m to regain vehicle "
"control before the fence switches the vehicle to the "
":ref:`FENCE_ACTION<FENCE_ACTION>` again.  If you really want to override the"
" fence, you should be ready to switch the flight mode twice or alternatively"
" set-up the enable/disable fence switch."
msgstr ""
"Copter 和 Rover 的备用围栏在上一次被突破的围栏外 20m 处创建，而非在飞行器当前位置外 20m "
"处。这意味着如果选择覆盖围栏，您可能拥有不足 20m 的距离来重新获得飞行器控制，之后围栏将再次切换飞行器至 "
":ref:`FENCE_ACTION<FENCE_ACTION>`。如果确实需要覆盖围栏，应准备好切换飞行模式两次，或设置围栏启用/禁用开关。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-polygon_fence.rst:62
#: 09a900bd696a40cbb504c558b50de14d 228cc4e476fa44efbd789558382db0d1
#: 7b1ff917c05f4cd9814d17168a614d90 8c5d463cb8544763ad82bf7f9a76e49c
#: f8439bf045704da39e677f70530db114
msgid ""
"You can define many inclusion and exclusion fences. However,multiple "
"inclusions fences, including the :ref:`cylindrical fences <common-"
"ac2_simple_geofence>` must overlap, since the vehicle can operate only "
"within the complete overlap area of all of the inclusion fences. Exclusion "
"fences may be placed within or outside of inclusion fences."
msgstr ""
"您可以定义多个包含和排除围栏。但多个包含围栏（包括 :ref:`圆柱形围栏 <common-"
"ac2_simple_geofence>`）必须相互重叠，因为飞行器只能在所有包含围栏的完整重叠区域内运行。排除围栏可以放置在包含围栏内或外。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-polygon_fence.rst:64
#: 0a0fd570af3b4948af90107d000b477b 1de990610616488a98ba7ecc38090307
#: 45ef4d935fe44916ba79af0da5d31568 a53c9ec7dcaf4eafb09aeeca940efd28
#: edeaacecb1a9492eb00fb6ae1bea5030
msgid ""
"In order to upload or download these fences from Mission Planner the "
"connected link must be using MAVLink2 protocol. Normally, since the USB "
"connection is used, this protocol is default. However, radio linked "
"connections may use MAVLink1 by default and would need to be changed to "
"MAVLink2 in order to upload and download across them."
msgstr ""
"为了通过 Mission Planner 上传或下载这些围栏，连接的链路必须使用 MAVLink2 协议。通常情况下，由于使用 USB "
"连接，该协议是默认的。但是，无线电链路连接可能默认使用 MAVLink1，需要更改为 MAVLink2 才能通过其上传和下载。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-polygon_fence.rst:66
#: 0da01168dc95431a8cf2c752b87b65c4 1271b68d0b7f4d12b58c6c4100309d42
#: 2faf2d40c0b64af7b37ec4a9612d71c8 729386df0b7c4417a54d30794ba30e67
#: a2f9291f23054c968e18b84d9e61416e
msgid ""
"You can have both the :ref:`cylindrical fences <common-ac2_simple_geofence>`"
" and inclusion/exclusion fences and choose to use just the HOME centered "
"\"tin-can\" for a flight by selecting only the \"Circle\" or \"Altitude and "
"Circle\" for :ref:`FENCE_TYPE<FENCE_TYPE>`. You can chose to enable the "
":ref:`cylindrical fences <common-ac2_simple_geofence>`, these "
"inclusion/exclusion fences, and/or altitude limit, in any combination, with "
"this parameter."
msgstr ""
"您可以同时使用 :ref:`圆柱形围栏 <common-ac2_simple_geofence>` 和包含/排除围栏，并通过在 "
":ref:`FENCE_TYPE<FENCE_TYPE>` 中只选择「Circle」或「Altitude and Circle」来仅使用以 Home "
"为中心的「圆柱体」进行飞行。您可以使用此参数以任意组合启用 :ref:`圆柱形围栏 <common-"
"ac2_simple_geofence>`、包含/排除围栏和/或高度限制。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-polygon_fence.rst:69
#: 03ecafcf95c242fd8330eae5bb11c629 694921ee7c1642e3a844fa3918a3ede9
#: 96b563cff8024df7ad507b317fef805d e4212474e1a449fbae2da347274d02a2
#: f8c9fa78e4584200a0b2ab3aa02f1515
msgid "Combining with the Cylindrical Fence"
msgstr "与圆柱形围栏结合使用"

#: ../../source/docs/common-polygon_fence.rst:71
#: 145308074b2148d89ccda62ab1acd2de 40ee1509d4b14420a3840f04a55c4562
#: c3bb1f3894eb40abb16d263f953293d3 eab2b11af81344ab942b27f7ec6fa91d
#: f326c63bf46f4fba8cc6c5ca3530b4e4
msgid ""
"A polygon fence can be used in combination with the :ref:`cylindrical fences"
" <common-ac2_simple_geofence>` and the failsafe behaviour (i.e. stop at the "
"fence or RTL) will trigger at whichever barrier the vehicle reaches first "
"(i.e. the green line shown below)"
msgstr ""
"多边形围栏可与 :ref:`圆柱形围栏 <common-ac2_simple_geofence>` 结合使用，失控保护行为（即在围栏处停止或 "
"RTL）将在飞行器首先到达哪个障碍时触发（即下图中绿色线所示）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-polygon_fence.rst:77
#: 0721015c1a344095b1cb7aa2849fe56c 77e4022066e44aa2a49bc57966562741
#: 992c4017660c414a999d4a521f55d70b ba34475bf03d45dfbc748dcf9580f0bf
#: d194a92599fb439c96e4875f7f63c4bf
msgid ""
"Please see the :ref:`Cylindrical Fence <common-ac2_simple_geofence>` page "
"for additional warnings and instructions including how to enable/disable the"
" fence with the RC channel auxiliary switches."
msgstr ""
"请参阅 :ref:`圆柱形围栏 <common-ac2_simple_geofence>` 页面，了解其他警告和说明，包括如何通过 RC "
"通道辅助开关启用/禁用围栏。"
